{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_C603F2EE","title":"Met Finn","entry":"Dlg_C603F2EE::entry","exit":"Dlg_C603F2EE::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_E353E22E","articyId":"72057697117164441","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Still vibin? What's got yah going round the tables?","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Still vibin? What's got yah going round the tables?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":500.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28370","byteOffset":18615672,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_DDD1D229","articyId":"72057697117164447","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"My friend. What can I do for you?","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My friend. What can I do for you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":500.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27165","byteOffset":18155432,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_D4FAFCA2","articyId":"72057697117164462","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Finn Amano mannnn. The late. The Great. The Spinner himself.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Finn Amano mannnn. The late. The Great. The Spinner himself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30689","byteOffset":19491000,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_BD18388C","articyId":"72057697117164490","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Whatever sounds I can weave into the airwaves.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whatever sounds I can weave into the airwaves.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1700.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41927","byteOffset":30188784,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_2CCB84B7","articyId":"72057697117164498","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Really now? I'm hoping it's for something good. Nah, I know it is. You got that vibe about you. Feel it pulsing like a mel-o-dyyyyy.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Really now? I'm hoping it's for something good. Nah, I know it is. You got that vibe about you. Feel it pulsing like a mel-o-dyyyyy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47400","byteOffset":32268616,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_17C558F2","articyId":"72057697117164514","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"You don't say... Kenzy's gonna try and get the Club Rat Kids crawling up the Spire again. Ridin' the thermals all the way to fresh air and clear skies.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't say... Kenzy's gonna try and get the Club Rat Kids crawling up the Spire again. Ridin' the thermals all the way to fresh air and clear skies.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21545","byteOffset":16039104,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_097F4B44","articyId":"72057697117164545","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"The Club Rat Kids. They were the best viral marketers in the biz. They knew everyone. Didn't matter what club you were at, somehow one of em was always there.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Club Rat Kids. They were the best viral marketers in the biz. They knew everyone. Didn't matter what club you were at, somehow one of em was always there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30231","byteOffset":19317088,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_C08DC34D","articyId":"72057697117164551","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Yeah, the reputation of the Club Rat Kids. They were the team to beat a few months ago. Promos at every club. Events every single night. Kenz was even in talks for a sponsorship deal with Liq-Hr.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, the reputation of the Club Rat Kids. They were the team to beat a few months ago. Promos at every club. Events every single night. Kenz was even in talks for a sponsorship deal with Liq-Hr.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47897","byteOffset":32455840,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_FE709CDD","articyId":"72057697117164567","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Depends on what side of the record is spinnin'. You playin' the B-sides too?","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Depends on what side of the record is spinnin'. You playin' the B-sides too?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4700.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29989","byteOffset":19225008,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_A278413F","articyId":"72057697117164581","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Ohhhh, she wants to collab with me! I thought you meant someone else and you were here to try and recruit me to help you stop her.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ohhhh, she wants to collab with me! I thought you meant someone else and you were here to try and recruit me to help you stop her.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5300.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36898","byteOffset":28302648,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_007EF226","articyId":"72057697117164602","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Listen, The Club Rat Kids were a family. Scrawny, misfits amped up on so many uppers they hummed like a synthesizer. What went down kinda broke 'em. I don't think they've really talked since.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Listen, The Club Rat Kids were a family. Scrawny, misfits amped up on so many uppers they hummed like a synthesizer. What went down kinda broke 'em. I don't think they've really talked since.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5900.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47571","byteOffset":32334688,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_EBAE3700","articyId":"72057697117164636","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"See the club scene in the upper levels operates on reputation. The more you have the more you know. The more you know the more you promote. You hit a level and people want you in their clubs just to say it happened.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"See the club scene in the upper levels operates on reputation. The more you have the more you know. The more you know the more you promote. You hit a level and people want you in their clubs just to say it happened.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":7100.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32816","byteOffset":20298696,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_FE6D5469","articyId":"72057697117164656","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Welllllll, that's the thing. It's like... It's like a fly on the wall of your skull, something pulsing to the beat of your soul. Yeah, that's good. That's the one.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Welllllll, that's the thing. It's like... It's like a fly on the wall of your skull, something pulsing to the beat of your soul. Yeah, that's good. That's the one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":7700.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27051","byteOffset":18112952,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_0C909CD3","articyId":"72057697117164671","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Tell Kenzy if she gets her rep back I'll wander over and we can pitch an event tent. See if we can scurry our way back up to the top.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Tell Kenzy if she gets her rep back I'll wander over and we can pitch an event tent. See if we can scurry our way back up to the top.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":8300.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48381","byteOffset":32639176,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_DFCB6CF8","articyId":"72057697117164678","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Ehhhhhhh. It's not my song to sing. If you help her get back into the scene, pull the Club Rats out from under the house, maybe she'll tell yah.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ehhhhhhh. It's not my song to sing. If you help her get back into the scene, pull the Club Rats out from under the house, maybe she'll tell yah.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":6500.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41788","byteOffset":30137064,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_4999F05F","articyId":"72057697117164714","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"In a different time, singing a different tune. Yeah, we all played together. Danced on glass floors while data streamed below through tubes of neon light.","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In a different time, singing a different tune. Yeah, we all played together. Danced on glass floors while data streamed below through tubes of neon light.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":8900.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37999","byteOffset":28710344,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_1B2EC3BE","articyId":"72057821671316390","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Finn Amano","text":"Glow sticks Kenzy? Kenzy Voan? You know her?","speakerId":"Ntt_465ED049","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHe